        "original_id": "b89adf7e-3fa0-5501-9180-a88264ea6d27",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Philadelphia Eagles\n- Seasons: 2004 Philadelphia Eagles season, 2005 Philadelphia Eagles season\n- Organizations: NFC East, Super Bowl\n- Events: division sweep, NFC title games\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2004 season, the Philadelphia Eagles swept their NFC East division rivals.\n- In the 2004 season, the Philadelphia Eagles were favored in the final two NFC title games but did not reach the Super Bowl.\n- In the 2005 season, the Philadelphia Eagles went 0–6 against the NFC East.\n- In the 2005 season, the Philadelphia Eagles became the first team to go from sweeping their division rivals one year to being swept by them the next season.",
